"""R84: the observation incremental test runs on the private repository workspace: trees are scratch directories inside it, the invocation is issued for it, the child reads the tree by its own working directory; and it states the rules the inference now keeps: a result derived from a file written within the racy window is never persisted, so the pass after a concurrent edit settles it once after the window; the persisted records carry the precision rule file as their one library fact."""
